  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><article class=\"pb-12 md:pb-20\"><header class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 container mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center px-4 pb-8 lg:pb-0 lg:px-0 lg:pr-12 order-last lg:order-first\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-6xl\">Stars of Stuttgart</h1><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"inline-block text-sm px-3 py-1 border border-black rounded-full\">Collections</span></div><span class=\"text-neutral-500 block mt-6\">Starting off the new year with 9 lovely Mercedes-Benz models!</span><div class=\"flex mt-6\"><div class=\"mr-2\"><a href=\"/en/authors/rasmus-christensen\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-full w-[48px]\" src=\"/assets/rasmus-christensen-51a88c90.jpg\"></a></div><div><a href=\"/en/authors/rasmus-christensen\" class=\"block hover:underline\">Rasmus Christensen</a><span class=\"block text-neutral-500 text-sm\">January 03, 2025 10:00</span></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-8 lg:mb-0\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/132faccfea0903771ed4ad931e2ec5ac\" width=\"1220\" height=\"840\"></div></div></header><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 my-8 lg:my-12\"><div class=\"xl:w-2/3 auction-body\"><p>We start the new year by presenting no less than nine Mercedes-Benz models, ranging from 1964 and onwards, all up for auction at the same time. These cars reflect the exceptional development of German engineering and design and offer a fantastic opportunity for both collectors and car enthusiasts to acquire a piece of Mercedes-Benz history.</p><p><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/bar-1-stars-of-stuttgart.jpeg\">The collection includes everything from a restoration project in the form of a 1964 Mercedes-Benz L911, a classic truck that is rare in Sweden, to an elegant 1967 Mercedes-Benz 250 S, a timeless sedan that captures the luxurious charm of the 60s. Following that, there's an impressive 1970s Mercedes-Benz 250, a car that has been restored to a very fine condition, offering both comfort and classic design.</p><p><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/bar-2-stars-of-stuttgart.jpeg\">For those seeking a youngtimer, we have a very well-maintained Mercedes-Benz 500 SEC in a beautiful green color, as well as a very well-kept 1989 Mercedes-Benz 300 TE 4Matic that needs a bit of love to regain its full potential.</p><p><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/bar-3-stars-of-stuttgart.jpeg\">If you enjoy the wind in your hair, we also offer three convertibles. How about a 1990 SL500 with only 55,400 km on the clock?! Or, for those looking for a newer model, perhaps a 2006 SL500 might suit you better—also in excellent condition and ready to be enjoyed.</p><p>For those seeking more than just high build quality and excellent comfort, we also have a 2003 SL 55 AMG, an incredible opportunity to acquire an iconic and well-maintained performance car in top condition.</p><p><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/bar-4-stars-of-stuttgart.jpeg\">Prefer enthusiast cars with performance but need more space than just your significant other in the passenger seat? Check out this fantastic family car refined by AMG—a 2006 R 63 AMG in the short body configuration. One of only 80 units produced and reportedly one of the rarest AMG cars!</p><p><br></p><p>Browse the cars below and don’t hesitate to reach out to our team if you have any questions!</p></div><div class=\"xl:w-2/3 mt-10 lg:mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">0 Comments</h2><div class=\"mb-16\"><span class=\"block border bg-rose-50 text-neutral-600 p-4 my-4 rounded\">You need to be signed in in order to post comments.</span><ul id=\"comments\"></ul></div></div></div></article><div class=\"bg-black text-white py-10 spotlight-theme\" style=\"\n      background-image: linear-gradient(to top, #000, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)),\n                        linear-gradient(to right, #000, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)),\n                        url('https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/132faccfea0903771ed4ad931e2ec5ac');\n    \"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 \"><h3 class=\"text-neutral-400\">The collection</h3><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight max-w-lg mb-4\"><a href=\"/en/themes/stars-of-stuttgart\" class=\"hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">Stars of Stuttgart</a></h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-lg mb-7\">Starting off the new year with 9 lovely Mercedes-Benz models!</p><div class=\"flex items-center font-medium gap-6\"><a href=\"/en/themes/stars-of-stuttgart\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300\">View collection</a><a href=\"/en/posts/stars-of-stuttgart-en\" class=\"text-jaffa hover:text-zest\">Read the article</a></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><h3 class=\"font-serif uppercase text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-racing-700 text-white pb-4\"><a href=\"/en/themes/stars-of-stuttgart\" class=\"hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">Discover</a></h3><style>\n        #theme_98b32744-f76f-4ac3-9e04-4b0c0781a965 { width: max(100%, 396%); }\n        @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {\n          #theme_98b32744-f76f-4ac3-9e04-4b0c0781a965 { width: max(100%, 162%); }\n        }\n      </style><div class=\"w-full overflow-x-auto snap-x\"><ul id=\"theme_98b32744-f76f-4ac3-9e04-4b0c0781a965\" class=\"flex gap-2 lg:gap-4\"><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/1977-mercedes-benz-l911-bsm726\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/322f6eaedb6f257b71d79e0b34b37a7d\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1964 Mercedes-Benz L911 BSM726\" width=\"820\" height