text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1978 Mercedes-Benz 250</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/1983-mercedes-benz-500-sec-wgg59f-2\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/19cd05a79290d0ac5bf9ba4a064b2851\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1983 Mercedes-Benz 500 SEC WGG59F\" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1983 Mercedes-Benz 500 SEC</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/2006-mercedes-benz-r63-amg-pfl17f\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/afeb6dc85f70a313ca4d974f6052e834\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"2006 Mercedes-Benz R 63 AMG PFL17F\" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">2006 Mercedes-Benz R 63 AMG</h4></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/en\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300 px-6 py-3\">View all our car auctions</a></div></main>",
